Greetings, Champions! 👊


Welcome to our first monthly Discord Battle Pass challenges!

Take part in the following missions, and you might win glorious prizes:


I - Don’t Lose Your Heart Challenge ❤️

Your first mission is to get as far as you can in the Arena without losing your first health level!
Record your Arena gameplay session and submit it on the channel #dont-lose-your-♥ over our Discord server following the rules explained further below.

II - Card Hunt Challenge 🃏

As for your second mission, you should find the 🃏 hidden on the server (on channels’ names or descriptions), and submit a screenshot of it following the rules below.
Get the @Card Hunter role on our Discord server to be notified when the hunt periods begin. They will be announced once per week, at random dates and times.


Rules 📜

Don’t Lose Your Heart:

 Submit your runs as Google Drive links on #dont-lose-your-♥;
 Your runs should be Arena gameplay videos recorded by yourself and uploaded to your personal Google Drive account;
 You can submit more than one run, as long as you post any additional ones as replies on a thread starting with your first one. Posting runs out of your thread will cause disqualification;
 Draws will be resolved by gameplay time, where the shortest will be the winner;
 Messages that aren’t submissions or off-topic conversations out of the submission threads on #dont-lose-your-♥ will be deleted and, their senders warned and/or disqualified upon repeated violation of this rule;
 The submission deadline is October 31st, 1 PM EST (or 12 PM CST).

Card Hunt:

 Submit your screenshots on the channel #card-hunt;
 Screenshots sent before the start announcement will be disqualified, as well as the participant who sent them;
 In case there's a draw on the time a certain screenshot is sent, the Community Manager will resolve it by rolling a virtual die;
 The submission deadline is the end of every week, by Saturdays at midnight CST.

Judging 🔍

Submissions will be judged by the Community Manager, and will be critiqued on the following:

Don’t Lose Your Heart:

 Rules validation;
 How far (and fast, in the case of draws) the participant got without losing the first health level.

Card Hunt:

 Rules validation;
 Who submitted the screenshot first, second, and third.

Prizes 🏆

Don’t Lose Your Heart:
First place:

 Suggest a Halloween skin for a card and a Halloween costume for one of the player characters! We will add those to the game after launch. You will be credited for them and get them for free;
 2x XP boost for one week for all your class members;
 5000 XP;
 3 unlock tokens.

Second place:

 1.5x XP boost for one week for all your class members;
 2500 XP;
 2 unlock tokens.

Third place:

 1.25x XP boost for one week for all your class members;
 1250 XP;
 1 unlock token.

Card Hunt:

 First place: 1000 XP;
 Second place: 500 XP;
 Third place: 250 XP.

+1000 XP to whoever finds the highest amount of cards during the month.


Also, upon the game’s full launch, special rewards will be granted to the members of the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd classes who succeed in the highest amount of Battle Passes.


So make sure to join our Discord server and may the most skilled Champions win! 💪
Distilled Gaming
